            <ArticleTitle>Effective services for the care of patients with back pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>422-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For the majority of patients with back pain the traditional medical model of care is not effective. For patients without any serious underlying pathology a biopsychosocial model of care, comprising education, relaxation, exercise and analgesia, is now advocated, as practiced by multidisciplinary teams such as the Nottingham Back Team.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
